-1b31befe", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "「未半日，群蜂满身攒聚，惊惶无措」——占后不到半日，群蜂满身攒聚，占者惊惶无措。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1b4e8a3d", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "「果应不来，但被日带父爻六害，乃受风雨淋漓之苦也」——倭寇果未至，唯占者遭风雨淋漓之苦。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1be98a3f", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "正夫人賢而無妒﹐夫妻同庚而生﹐妻活八旬有一﹐夫年八十二歲。此卦若以世應相沖相克而斷之﹐遠如天壤。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1c791f5d", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後報升於巳月﹐"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1c8ded4a", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "直至戊寅年戊午月壬戌日故。世爻正值岁旬空亡，又被年月日会成火局克世，且世爻绝于岁建，败于月建，衰于日建，故当终也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1cb77ee4", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "颜惠庆1933年（癸酉）出任驻苏联大使，与断语所指年份、职务相合；后任驻美大使等职，1950年卒于上海。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1cef5c30", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果然无事（子病无事）。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1d40f60b", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后逢亥令解组。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1db33fb0", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後此人買攢香翠毛而歸﹐俱得大利。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1ddde5ef", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后遇丁丑，冲动未爻，其弟乃还。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1e33789f", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "至下岁孟春方绝。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-1f98de00", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实：王晓籁为上海商界领袖，子女三十余人属实（原书自载沪人话之熟矣）；1955年后居香港经商，卒年不详于本数据集所据