rection": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "「果当日辰时止息」——飓风果于当日辰时停息。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2632cef7", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "众不然其说，三月冯大司寇上疏，旨意驳下，四月上疏，依拟脱离。三月驳、四月脱离与断语对应；原文未逐字复核「甲戌日巳时」的日时细节，评分时该细项请按未完全复核处理。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-26ce9c7e", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於八月其子驚風﹐又來卜之。 果死於卯日。夫應於卯日者﹐乃實破之日也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-26e368af", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "及至三月將軍之侄因昔年因陳不前﹐都中有人報出行文拿問﹔"}, {"anon_id": "P3-27603416", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "「果应无事」——其人果得无事。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-28e99209", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "至戊申日沈屙復起，其可謂之蛇動死，虎動主喪耶？"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2a93c372", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "未几，工科上疏题复巡按差，巡方官复设；吏书缺未复。原文以「以四课不全，故占二得一」收束，应验段独立。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2ab15219", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "直至丙子年丙申月庚辰日故。财虽不值岁旬空亡，以遇流年天克地冲，又被岁月日会而成水局，克制火财，所以终命也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2adbfb08", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於申日文書實收俱到﹐"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2b286960", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "丑年发甲是也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2c8e4fdf", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "彼曰：一一果然，葬可好否？予曰：依予取水作朝，棄山作向，許必大發，彼果依斷，葬後即如所言．"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2cc5a14b", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "而当日甲子即归。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2d04a128", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於次日退災﹐不藥而愈﹐"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2d1c0eb7", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果后三日自刘家集寻得。后三日在刘家集寻得，与「三日内必获」对应（马色与西北方位两项原文未另逐字复核，评分时按未复核处理）。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2d9984f5", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於戌時﹐星辰無光。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2e455956", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後因叔父作衙門命之貼﹐寫得上人之意﹐可度日而財不聚。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2f648baf", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後果無音訊﹐四年知父而遇害矣。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-2ffe465b", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "次日午時，果有貴官觀牡丹，二馬相齧，群至花間馳驟，花盡為之踐毀"}, {"anon_id": "P3-31416e30", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "又本府府尊命下﹐不準復職﹐後援刑例果於巳年補陜慶陽府知府。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-31a04cd2", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後於申年升任﹐應申年者﹐值官之年也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-31bcfd09", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后果同行都下。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-3214a7f6", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后甲午榜中式（辛卯年是岁失利）。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-322fce95", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "袁寒云1931年（辛未）病逝于天津，年仅41岁；生前以名士自放，未任显职，与断语所论性情、际遇、卒年相合。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-32ad3a2f", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "韩国瑜2020年败选，同年6月6日再被罢免高雄市长职务，连第一关都未过"}, {"anon_id": "P3-32ee8680", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後蒙恩免死。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-34177fdf", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "此後至辛丑日尙亦見其凶非﹐因一言觸怒上司﹐幾乎危殆﹐幸得解救。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-343384d3", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实同 ren-016：乾隆帝在位60年，1799年卒，享寿87岁"}, {"anon_id": "P3-360193b0", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "起官一项原文以「后果然」短承；次年冬，推补兵部车驾司。得职之时点（次年冬）与职名（兵部车驾司）具体载于原文应验段。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-366dc576", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后果于九月己卯日巳时生男，母子俱得平安。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-36e818b6", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於申時到。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-372fca83", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "已而果然。原文以「已而果然」承「七月必死」之断（应验句紧承断语末句、所指唯一），七月死期为本课结局。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-376a0823", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "次日戊申，财爻绝处逢生，方入手也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-38818f7c", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "韩国瑜2019年4月表态参选、7月赢得国民党初选成为总统候选人，2020年1月败选；「不会参选」断言落空（16年大运说无从单独证伪，不计）"}, {"anon_id": "P3-394b7900", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於巳年得縣缺"}, {"anon_id": "P3-3a90d530", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果然在第二年寅月沒有中榜﹐"}, {"anon_id": "P3-3ad57acb", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後因病重，此人未去，女死辰日，夫應不去者，世動而逢合也，女死辰日者，卯木子孫變辰土之故也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-3b0eb024", "predic